      "created_at": "2026-11-19T15:55:28.000Z",
      "text": "India’s foreign policy must be guided by what is good for India.\n\nI support a strong relationship with Israel. We have strategic interests, including buying the best weapons for our armed forces. But that cannot mean silence on Gaza.\n\nI condemn the October 7th attacks and the killing of innocent people. I also condemn what Israel has done in Gaza. One wrong cannot justify another.\n\nWe are a nation of 1.5 billion people. No country - Israel, USA, Russia or China - should hold us back from playing our rightful role on the global stage.\n\nIndia must stand for what it believes in.",
      "lang": "en",
      "public_metrics": {
        "reply_count": 533,
